1
00:00:00,914 --> 00:00:04,314
I can't believe he's gonna marry the girl
he cheated on me with.

2
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:05,578
(Leonard:)Isn't it kind of nice?

3
00:00:05,786 --> 00:00:08,486
(Leonard:)He was with the wrong person.
Now he found the right person.

4
00:00:08,689 --> 00:00:12,289
(Penny:)So I'm the wrong person?
Maybe you wanna be with Gretchen too.

5
00:00:14,528 --> 00:00:15,928
(Bernadette:)They do look happy.

6
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,190
(Howard:)Yeah, maybe tonight.

7
00:00:17,431 --> 00:00:20,921
(Howard:)But a year from now, he'll be crawling
under the sink looking for his Xbox.

8
00:00:22,436 --> 00:00:23,596
(Howard:)Well, he will.

9
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:28,699
(Leonard:)Why don't we just forget about them
and enjoy our Valentine's Day?

10
00:00:28,942 --> 00:00:30,502
(Penny:)Yes, absolutely.

11
00:00:35,816 --> 00:00:39,976
Heh. Now they're doing that phony,
link-arm-drink thingy.

12
00:00:40,187 --> 00:00:42,617
(Penny:)I totally taught him that.

13
00:00:44,558 --> 00:00:47,928
- I thought we were letting it go.
- We were. It's just not fair, okay?

14
00:00:48,128 --> 00:00:49,148
(Penny:)They're bad people.

15
00:00:49,363 --> 00:00:52,633
(Penny:)Not supposed to end happy for them,
it's supposed to end happy for me.

16
00:00:52,933 --> 00:00:56,163
(Leonard:)Um, it did end happy for you.
You're here with me.

17
00:00:56,370 --> 00:00:59,020
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah, I know.

